From fcc52fe271d0384188101c5103571f1891373518 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 48/60] tlsspoof: the forged ClientHello the way the connection
 goes, REALITY takes it

The forged ClientHello of tls.spoof goes out the way the connection goes and nothing else does;
REALITY takes the spoof options.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  1dfa4d379 tlsspoof: send the forged ClientHello the way the connection goes, and nothing else
  94d0be40d reality: take the tls spoof options
  0b4b1e56c tlsspoof: what the review of the forged ClientHello showed

Pdk-Feature: tlsspoof
Pdk-Zone: protocols
Pdk-Layer: 04
